Z||000008||artherd||12-04-2001||12:57 AM||||225-40-18 on 18x7.5" front and<BR>265-35-18 on 18x10" rear wheels and tires finally ordered and shipped!  Should be here in 7-10 days, I CAN'T WAIT!!!<P>They should just barely fit too.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>PS: if you go with a 17 or larger wheel, you can fit more rubber on the rear as the bigger wheel won't hit 'rubber' untill it's past the rear knuckle.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
